{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-tsx","path":"/blog/my-boxing-journey/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"id":"6108b2ee-bcc2-5c69-8dce-fc291eb5cd14","excerpt":"If you box, you already know what this is about. I am a year in, and I am only now finding the words for it. You did not expect it to matter this much…","html":"<p>If you box, you already know what this is about. I am a year in, and I am only now finding the words for it.</p>\n<p>You did not expect it to matter this much. Something you came to try has become the thing your days are built around, and you could not say when that happened.</p>\n<p>You know how hard it is to explain. It is challenging, it is interesting, and it is mysterious. It is a forest full of hidden things. Every time you think you have understood a little of it, there is more behind the next tree. Nothing else you have played has ever felt like this.</p>\n<p>You know the nerves before a spar, and how quiet they go once it starts. You know what it is to get hit, touch gloves, and feel only respect for the person who hit you. No other place turns strangers into your people that quickly.</p>\n<p><figure class=\"gatsby-resp-image-figure\" style=\"margin: 0;\">\n    <span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 1360px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/15177cb9f8a0a6b25c0dcf6e7fb9942b/490e5/sparring-exchange.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 57.35294117647059%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/15177cb9f8a0a6b25c0dcf6e7fb9942b/51a8e/sparring-exchange.webp 340w,\n/static/15177cb9f8a0a6b25c0dcf6e7fb9942b/713b7/sparring-exchange.webp 680w,\n/static/15177cb9f8a0a6b25c0dcf6e7fb9942b/54376/sparring-exchange.webp 1360w,\n/static/15177cb9f8a0a6b25c0dcf6e7fb9942b/134ac/sparring-exchange.webp 1600w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 1360px) 100vw, 1360px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/15177cb9f8a0a6b25c0dcf6e7fb9942b/2e524/sparring-exchange.jpg 340w,\n/static/15177cb9f8a0a6b25c0dcf6e7fb9942b/d330d/sparring-exchange.jpg 680w,\n/static/15177cb9f8a0a6b25c0dcf6e7fb9942b/6c26c/sparring-exchange.jpg 1360w,\n/static/15177cb9f8a0a6b25c0dcf6e7fb9942b/490e5/sparring-exchange.jpg 1600w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 1360px) 100vw, 1360px\"\n            type=\"image/jpeg\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/15177cb9f8a0a6b25c0dcf6e7fb9942b/6c26c/sparring-exchange.jpg\"\n            alt=\"My first sparring session\"\n            title=\"My first sparring session, Saroornagar Indoor Stadium, Hyderabad\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption class=\"gatsby-resp-image-figcaption\">My first sparring session, Saroornagar Indoor Stadium, Hyderabad</figcaption>\n  </figure></p>\n<p>It is not discipline that brings you back, and it is not a goal. It is love for the sport, and the excitement of being a little better than you were yesterday. You learn something new every single day. You already know you will never be finished, and you are glad of it.</p>\n<p>You thought it would change your body. It changed your days. You are calmer. Hard things feel lighter. You carry it with you long after the gloves are off.</p>\n<p>I wish I had found it years ago. But I found it, and I am not letting go.</p>\n<p>If you are one of us, I hope to share a ring with you someday. And if you have not found it yet, come and find out.</p>\n<h2>Gallery</h2>\n<p><figure class=\"gatsby-resp-image-figure\" style=\"margin: 0;\">\n    <span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 1080px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/2d03cb849f252bd2a3c9ce055e5ebc5e/b2ead/bag-class.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 54.41176470588235%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/2d03cb849f252bd2a3c9ce055e5ebc5e/51a8e/bag-class.webp 340w,\n/static/2d03cb849f252bd2a3c9ce055e5ebc5e/713b7/bag-class.webp 680w,\n/static/2d03cb849f252bd2a3c9ce055e5ebc5e/efbf3/bag-class.webp 1080w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 1080px) 100vw, 1080px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/2d03cb849f252bd2a3c9ce055e5ebc5e/2e524/bag-class.jpg 340w,\n/static/2d03cb849f252bd2a3c9ce055e5ebc5e/d330d/bag-class.jpg 680w,\n/static/2d03cb849f252bd2a3c9ce055e5ebc5e/b2ead/bag-class.jpg 1080w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 1080px) 100vw, 1080px\"\n            type=\"image/jpeg\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/2d03cb849f252bd2a3c9ce055e5ebc5e/b2ead/bag-class.jpg\"\n            alt=\"An early morning session\"\n            title=\"The way it began as a bag session at cult.fit\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption class=\"gatsby-resp-image-figcaption\">The way it began as a bag session at cult.fit</figcaption>\n  </figure></p>\n<p><figure class=\"gatsby-resp-image-figure\" style=\"margin: 0;\">\n    <span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 1360px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/793f91dcbff1ccab8f13717dee909ebb/490e5/the-ring.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 72.05882352941177%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/793f91dcbff1ccab8f13717dee909ebb/51a8e/the-ring.webp 340w,\n/static/793f91dcbff1ccab8f13717dee909ebb/713b7/the-ring.webp 680w,\n/static/793f91dcbff1ccab8f13717dee909ebb/54376/the-ring.webp 1360w,\n/static/793f91dcbff1ccab8f13717dee909ebb/134ac/the-ring.webp 1600w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 1360px) 100vw, 1360px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/793f91dcbff1ccab8f13717dee909ebb/2e524/the-ring.jpg 340w,\n/static/793f91dcbff1ccab8f13717dee909ebb/d330d/the-ring.jpg 680w,\n/static/793f91dcbff1ccab8f13717dee909ebb/6c26c/the-ring.jpg 1360w,\n/static/793f91dcbff1ccab8f13717dee909ebb/490e5/the-ring.jpg 1600w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 1360px) 100vw, 1360px\"\n            type=\"image/jpeg\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/793f91dcbff1ccab8f13717dee909ebb/6c26c/the-ring.jpg\"\n            alt=\"The ring at the stadium\"\n            title=\"The ring at the stadium\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption class=\"gatsby-resp-image-figcaption\">The ring at the stadium</figcaption>\n  </figure></p>\n<p><figure class=\"gatsby-resp-image-figure\" style=\"margin: 0;\">\n    <span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 1360px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/42508f78b6c12ac6550241bc93a130be/490e5/sparring-jab.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 78.52941176470588%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/42508f78b6c12ac6550241bc93a130be/51a8e/sparring-jab.webp 340w,\n/static/42508f78b6c12ac6550241bc93a130be/713b7/sparring-jab.webp 680w,\n/static/42508f78b6c12ac6550241bc93a130be/54376/sparring-jab.webp 1360w,\n/static/42508f78b6c12ac6550241bc93a130be/134ac/sparring-jab.webp 1600w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 1360px) 100vw, 1360px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/42508f78b6c12ac6550241bc93a130be/2e524/sparring-jab.jpg 340w,\n/static/42508f78b6c12ac6550241bc93a130be/d330d/sparring-jab.jpg 680w,\n/static/42508f78b6c12ac6550241bc93a130be/6c26c/sparring-jab.jpg 1360w,\n/static/42508f78b6c12ac6550241bc93a130be/490e5/sparring-jab.jpg 1600w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 1360px) 100vw, 1360px\"\n            type=\"image/jpeg\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/42508f78b6c12ac6550241bc93a130be/6c26c/sparring-jab.jpg\"\n            alt=\"Taking a jab\"\n            title=\"Not getting hit is the hard part\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption class=\"gatsby-resp-image-figcaption\">Not getting hit is the hard part</figcaption>\n  </figure></p>\n<!-- ![Shadow boxing at home](./shadow-boxing-at-home.jpg \"Shadow boxing at home. It does not stay at the stadium.\") -->\n<hr>\n<p><em>Inspired by <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DeT8MuzA4jm/\">“Love At First Fight”</a> by Boxing Basement, a few lines that said what I had been feeling for a year.</em></p>","frontmatter":{"title":"Three Rounds","date":"November 03, 2026","isoDate":"2026-11-03","subtext":"For anyone who walked into a boxing gym and never really left","description":"A year into boxing, a note on what it feels like when a sport gets hold of you. For anyone who boxes, and anyone curious about why people do."}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/my-boxing-journey/","previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/living-asynchronously/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Living Asynchronously"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/money-cant-buy-what-a-job-takes/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Money Can't Buy What a Job Takes"}}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1740765634","3341275596"],"slicesMap":{}}